start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch [3dc 2ch]x3}@ring ss@top
R2: ch sc@same 2sc {sc 2ch sc}@sp [3sc {sc 2ch sc}@sp]x3 ss@top
R3: ch sc@same 3ch sk sc 3ch sk {sc 3ch sc}@sp [[3ch sk sc]x2 3ch sk {sc 3ch sc}@sp]x3 3ch sk sc@top
R4: sl@sp {3ch=dc 2dc}@same ch sk {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp [ch sk 3dc@sp ch sk {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp]x3 ch ss@top
R5: ch sc@same [[sc]>corner {sc 2ch sc}@sp]x4 [sc]>end ss@top
R6: ch sc@same 3ch [[sk sc 3ch]>corner {sc 3ch sc}@sp 3ch]x4 [3ch sk sc]>end 3ch ss@top
R7: sl@sp {3ch=dc 2dc}@same ch [[sk 3dc@sp ch]>corner {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp ch]x4 [sk 3dc@sp ch]>end ss@top
R8: ch sc@same [[sc]>corner {sc 2ch sc}@sp]x4 [sc]>end ss@top
R9: ch sc@same 3ch [[sk sc 3ch]>corner {sc 3ch sc}@sp 3ch]x4 [3ch sk sc]>end 3ch ss@top fo
